      "id": "claim_dc4b5f7e0f284b0b95699ed3399bc284",
      "statement": "OCM authentication supports fresh authorization-code and device flows without a token cache, selected by an explicit per-command override (--auth-flow for `session credentials configure ocm`, --ocm-auth-flow for `session create`) or a global device-code default, and reduces OAuth responses to short-lived access-token material via accessTokenOnly while clearing the SDK oauth2.Token object's AccessToken and RefreshToken fields.",
